<title>HUNGARY: OTP sells own shares of 379.6 mln forints.</title>
<headline>OTP sells own shares of 379.6 mln forints.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's OTP Bank sold own shares of 379.6 million forint worth at face value to a financial investor, the bank said in the Budapest Stock Exchange's (BSE) official gazette on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal was struck outside the bourse, the bank said, without disclosing the price of the shares.</p>
<p>OTP finished at 4,250 forints on the BSE on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
